                rdfs:label "Racial Disparities in Policing"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The meme references the real-world phenomenon of systemic racism in law enforcement, where people of color are disproportionately targeted, stopped, searched, and subjected to use of force compared to white individuals. This is a well-documented social issue in many countries, particularly in the United States, and forms the core context for the meme's message."@en ;
                :extractionMethod "llm_extraction_huggingface" ;
