                rdfs:label "White Privilege in Police Encounters"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The meme implicitly references the concept of white privilege, which describes the societal advantages that white people experience in systems like law enforcement, including being less likely to be targeted or harmed during police interactions. This is a sociological concept that explains the perceived 'gotcha' moment described in the text."@en ;
